  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Md. Code Ann., Public Safety § 5-306(a-3)): (A–3) (1) (I) ON OR BEFORE OCTOBER 1, 2024, AND EACH OCTOBER 1 THEREAFTER, THE SECRETARY, IN CONSULTATION WITH THE OFFICE OF THE ATTORNEY GENERAL, SHALL PUBLISH A HANDBOOK SUMMARIZING THE STATE LAWS THAT APPLY TO THE WEARING, CARRYING, AND TRANSPORTING OF A HANDGUN IN PUBLIC IN THE STATE. (II) THE SECRETARY SHALL DRAFT THE HANDBOOK IN PLAIN LANGUAGE THAT CAN BE EASILY UNDERSTOOD WITHOUT ANY SPECIAL KNOWLEDGE OF THE LAWS OF THE STATE. (2) THE SECRETARY SHALL MAKE COPIES OF THE HANDBOOK AVAILABLE TO MEMBERS OF THE PUBLIC: (I) IN PRINTED FORM; AND (II) IN ELECTRONIC FORM, ACCESSIBLE ON THE DEPARTMENT’S PUBLIC WEBSITE. (3) EACH TIME THE SECRETARY PUBLISHES AN UPDATED VERSION OF THE HANDBOOK, THE SECRETARY SHALL PROMPTLY NOTIFY EACH PERSON WHO CURRENTLY HOLDS A HANDGUN PERMIT UNDER THIS SECTION BY E–MAIL: (I) THAT A NEW VERSION OF THE HANDBOOK HAS BEEN PUBLISHED; AND (II) HOW TO OBTAIN THE HANDBOOK."
}